  "exactClauseRecordsRetainedWithOriginalGlobalNotReviewedState": [
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B005",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805"
      ],
      "text": "805.         急速",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B006",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.1"
      ],
      "text": "805.1.            [急速]是一种可选额外费用关键词。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B007",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.1.a"
      ],
      "text": "805.1.a.              [急速]会出现在单位上。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B008",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.1.b"
      ],
      "text": "805.1.b.              [急速]为以下功能的简称:“打出我时,你可以选择额外支付[1]和[C]。若如此做,则我以活跃状态进场。”",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B009",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.1.b.1"
      ],
      "text": "805.1.b.1.                   如果该单位拥有一种或多种特性,则[急速]费用的符能部分仅可使用与该单位其中一种特性相\n                             匹配的符能支付。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B010",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.1.b.2"
      ],
      "text": "805.1.b.2.                   如果该单位没有特性,则[急速]费用的符能部分可使用[A](任意特性的符能)进行支付。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B011",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.2"
      ],
      "text": "805.2.            [急速]为可选额外费用,需要玩家在打出具有该技能的单位时支付。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B012",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.2.a"
      ],
      "text": "805.2.a.              只有作为打出卡牌的步骤时,才能支付[急速]的费用。如果单位已经位于场上,则无法支付该费用。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B013",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.2.b"
      ],
      "text": "805.2.b.              支付急速费用会生成延迟替换效果。即使该单位在确认过程中失去了[急速]关键词,只要已支付费用,该\n                      单位仍会以活跃状态进场。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B014",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.3"
      ],
      "text": "805.3.            [急速]在场上时没有任何功能。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B015",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.4"
      ],
      "text": "805.4.            即使拥有多个[急速],也只会生效一次。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B016",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.5"
      ],
      "text": "805.5.            [急速],以及单位是否拥有[急速],是单位的一个特性,其他游戏效果可以检查或引用该特性。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B017",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.6"
      ],
      "text": "805.6.            [急速]会生成延迟替换效果,将原本的“单位以休眠状态进场”替换为“单位以活跃状态进场”。单位不是“以休眠状态进\n                  场,然后再进入活跃状态”。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-01-P114-B018",
      "document": "DOC-01",
      "page": 114,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "805.6.a"
      ],
      "text": "805.6.a.              对于因单位变为活跃状态而受影响的技能,[急速]既不会与其互动,也不会将其触发。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-14-P019-B003",
      "document": "DOC-14",
      "page": 19,
      "clauseAnchors": [],
      "text": "Q:我方基地中存在【雷克塞 -    A:会,“黄沙士兵”\n               黄沙噬猎】,我方打出的“黄沙士     的<急速>费用为\n                 兵”,会获得<急速>吗?        [1][A]。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    }
